(6258667, 925813, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is a quality about this image that reminds me of a rear-projection photo.  There is also a 3-D quality created by the snowflakes between us and the subject.  Love this.  Though it''s wintery, there is something very warm about it.  Perhaps is very casual strolling stance, and the empty and snowy street.</td>', 'There is a quality about this image that reminds me of a rear-projection photo.  There is also a 3-D quality created by the snowflakes between us and the subject.  Love this.  Though it''s wintery, there is something very warm about it.  Perhaps is very casual strolling stance, and the empty and snowy street.', '2010-12-21 01:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
