(6259947, 925911, 93283, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and overall feel of the shot. 8</td>', 'I really like the composition and overall feel of the shot. 8', '2010-12-22 18:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6259948, 925895, 93283, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, and I think the centered composition works well here. 7</td>', 'I like this shot, and I think the centered composition works well here. 7', '2010-12-22 18:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6259949, 925665, 93283, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, focus and composition are spot on. 8</td>', 'Beautiful image, focus and composition are spot on. 8', '2010-12-22 18:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260012, 925061, 33672, '<td valign="top">Perfect   10</td>', 'Perfect   10', '2010-12-22 20:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260031, 925848, 40718, '<td valign="top">Did I say that offer was for you?  I gave this a 5. Technically it''s a bit dingy, but that''s probably a product of your homogeneously gray sky, which I''m sure you would have chosen to be different if you could.  Hope that helps.</td>', 'Did I say that offer was for you?  I gave this a 5. Technically it''s a bit dingy, but that''s probably a product of your homogeneously gray sky, which I''m sure you would have chosen to be different if you could.  Hope that helps.', '2010-12-22 21:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260035, 925567, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice.. you really captured the cold. Great picture for the topic, imo.</td>', 'Nice.. you really captured the cold. Great picture for the topic, imo.', '2010-12-22 21:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260036, 925637, 100831, '<td valign="top">excellent thinking. i LIKE it.</td>', 'excellent thinking. i LIKE it.', '2010-12-22 21:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260037, 925824, 100831, '<td valign="top">but is it a portrait? Well, I like the picture anyway.</td>', 'but is it a portrait? Well, I like the picture anyway.', '2010-12-22 21:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260040, 925848, 100831, '<td valign="top">I SO want to crop this, either from the top or the bottom (except I love the shadow). That said, I love the color pink and I''ll give it a 7</td>', 'I SO want to crop this, either from the top or the bottom (except I love the shadow). That said, I love the color pink and I''ll give it a 7', '2010-12-22 21:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260042, 925866, 100831, '<td valign="top">without a doubt.. my favorite in the challenge. French speaks to me more than any other language but this is a great picture for the title.</td>', 'without a doubt.. my favorite in the challenge. French speaks to me more than any other language but this is a great picture for the title.', '2010-12-22 21:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260043, 925149, 100831, '<td valign="top">did it work?</td>', 'did it work?', '2010-12-22 21:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260178, 925919, 114285, '<td valign="top">How terribly gorgeous, love the bouncy dog, and the PP on this.</td>', 'How terribly gorgeous, love the bouncy dog, and the PP on this.', '2010-12-23 02:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260179, 925903, 114285, '<td valign="top">Superb, one of the better ones, looks very Melethia like.</td>', 'Superb, one of the better ones, looks very Melethia like.', '2010-12-23 03:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260180, 925885, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the colours.</td>', 'Very nice, love the colours.', '2010-12-23 03:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260225, 925618, 107414, '<td valign="top">a timeless image, and beautiful.</td>', 'a timeless image, and beautiful.', '2010-12-23 06:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260322, 925545, 113156, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and title, there is maybe a bit to much sepia effect for my taste, all in all a very nice shot.</td>', 'I like the idea and title, there is maybe a bit to much sepia effect for my taste, all in all a very nice shot.', '2010-12-23 11:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260324, 925917, 113156, '<td valign="top">stunning photo and of course its also perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'stunning photo and of course its also perfect for the challenge.', '2010-12-23 11:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260339, 925878, 113156, '<td valign="top">I always try convincing myself that its not the size that counts, she obviously does not agree, besides that this is a very nice photo i like the way she has her foot posed on the camera, nice touch.</td>', 'I always try convincing myself that its not the size that counts, she obviously does not agree, besides that this is a very nice photo i like the way she has her foot posed on the camera, nice touch.', '2010-12-23 11:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260340, 925929, 113156, '<td valign="top">I''m big on motion blur so this photo appeals to me, some might say this is not a portrait but so what its a very cool photo.</td>', 'I''m big on motion blur so this photo appeals to me, some might say this is not a portrait but so what its a very cool photo.', '2010-12-23 11:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260346, 925149, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was going to ask how this was behind, and call it dnmc, then I realized he is behind the magazine. Extra pointage for meeting the challenge in a sneaky way.</td>', 'I was going to ask how this was behind, and call it dnmc, then I realized he is behind the magazine. Extra pointage for meeting the challenge in a sneaky way.', '2010-12-23 11:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260347, 925929, 83313, '<td valign="top">Took me a few moments to figure out that this person was snowboarding. I like this, it conveys the action quite well, and in a dramatic way.</td>', 'Took me a few moments to figure out that this person was snowboarding. I like this, it conveys the action quite well, and in a dramatic way.', '2010-12-23 11:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260351, 925886, 83313, '<td valign="top">Must fit the challenge in some non-obvious manner, I suppose. Perhaps he is looking over his shoulder?</td>', 'Must fit the challenge in some non-obvious manner, I suppose. Perhaps he is looking over his shoulder?', '2010-12-23 11:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260360, 925731, 113156, '<td valign="top">I like the way her hair resembles the washed up wood, there is maybe a bit to much vignetting going on especially above her head but this is still a good shot IMO.</td>', 'I like the way her hair resembles the washed up wood, there is maybe a bit to much vignetting going on especially above her head but this is still a good shot IMO.', '2010-12-23 12:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260379, 925813, 112972, '<td valign="top">What an awesome photograph!  Love the fact that the subject is wearing dark cloths because it helps the snow that is falling behind him a lot more visible.  I wonder what your aperture was here.  f/1.8?</td>', 'What an awesome photograph!  Love the fact that the subject is wearing dark cloths because it helps the snow that is falling behind him a lot more visible.  I wonder what your aperture was here.  f/1.8?', '2010-12-23 12:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260381, 925914, 112972, '<td valign="top">This is my pick for the blue.  Great creativity!  Love the sepia tones too.  Just an awesome photograph!  I can see some people may have wanted to see the full tree, but not a big enough deal to mark it dow for.  I wonder how the photo would have looked if you lowered your angle somewhat more and had the little girl a little off-center.  Great work!</td>', 'This is my pick for the blue.  Great creativity!  Love the sepia tones too.  Just an awesome photograph!  I can see some people may have wanted to see the full tree, but not a big enough deal to mark it dow for.  I wonder how the photo would have looked if you lowered your angle somewhat more and had the little girl a little off-center.  Great work!', '2010-12-23 12:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260382, 925929, 112972, '<td valign="top">Wow, I picked my blue for this challenge a few photographs back, but now after having seen this one, I am not so sure anymore.  This could be the one!  Simply incredible shot!!!  I think one thing that adds to the awesomeness of this photograph is the patters/color in the bottom of board. Easy 10!</td>', 'Wow, I picked my blue for this challenge a few photographs back, but now after having seen this one, I am not so sure anymore.  This could be the one!  Simply incredible shot!!!  I think one thing that adds to the awesomeness of this photograph is the patters/color in the bottom of board. Easy 10!', '2010-12-23 12:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260385, 925861, 112972, '<td valign="top">Good to see that someone has actually photographed more than 1 person from the back.  Lovely picture!</td>', 'Good to see that someone has actually photographed more than 1 person from the back.  Lovely picture!', '2010-12-23 12:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260458, 925325, 56828, '<td valign="top">It looks like you were going for an almost ghostlike effect, but the shot is too noisy and blurry.  Looks almost like a cell phone pic.</td>', 'It looks like you were going for an almost ghostlike effect, but the shot is too noisy and blurry.  Looks almost like a cell phone pic.', '2010-12-23 14:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260459, 925149, 56828, '<td valign="top">This isn''t behind anyone and is taken from in front.  Also the blur movements don''t add to teh photo.</td>', 'This isn''t behind anyone and is taken from in front.  Also the blur movements don''t add to teh photo.', '2010-12-23 14:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260460, 925501, 56828, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the plur technique</td>', 'Not a big fan of the plur technique', '2010-12-23 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260465, 925866, 56828, '<td valign="top">Looks lke it was taken through a window on a rainy day.</td>', 'Looks lke it was taken through a window on a rainy day.', '2010-12-23 15:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260466, 925920, 56828, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what special effect or filter was used here, but it really hurt this photo.  And there are points where her and santa blend together.</td>', 'I''m not sure what special effect or filter was used here, but it really hurt this photo.  And there are points where her and santa blend together.', '2010-12-23 15:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260468, 925668, 56828, '<td valign="top">Too busy and nothing really of interest.  It actually looks like you were trying to sneak a picture of this lady''s butt.</td>', 'Too busy and nothing really of interest.  It actually looks like you were trying to sneak a picture of this lady''s butt.', '2010-12-23 15:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260469, 925649, 56828, '<td valign="top">Bad lighting and subject choice.  Probably could have faired better if you had focused on the crowd, but probably wouldn''t have helped much.</td>', 'Bad lighting and subject choice.  Probably could have faired better if you had focused on the crowd, but probably wouldn''t have helped much.', '2010-12-23 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260472, 925835, 56828, '<td valign="top">Should have been tighter.  Having the photo zoomed this far out, you put alot of emphasis on the background rather than the mother and son.  This idea could have worked wel.</td>', 'Should have been tighter.  Having the photo zoomed this far out, you put alot of emphasis on the background rather than the mother and son.  This idea could have worked wel.', '2010-12-23 15:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260473, 925107, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Not sure if I like the crop through the middle of her head. Less table and more head would have been better.</td>', 'I like the idea. Not sure if I like the crop through the middle of her head. Less table and more head would have been better.', '2010-12-23 15:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260475, 925859, 56828, '<td valign="top">The blur technique hurts this photo.</td>', 'The blur technique hurts this photo.', '2010-12-23 15:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260478, 925725, 56828, '<td valign="top">The blur on this photo hurt this shot.  Also the crop puts more focus on the subway sign rather than the person.  You don''t get any essence about this person.</td>', 'The blur on this photo hurt this shot.  Also the crop puts more focus on the subway sign rather than the person.  You don''t get any essence about this person.', '2010-12-23 15:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260479, 925808, 56828, '<td valign="top">The crop, focus, lighting puts too much focus on the environment rather than the person.</td>', 'The crop, focus, lighting puts too much focus on the environment rather than the person.', '2010-12-23 15:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260487, 925895, 83313, '<td valign="top">Overall a well done portrait. I like the setting and the effective b/w tones. My one nitpick is the expression on her face seems kind of blah to me. It''s not friendly and inviting, but does not convey anything else to me either. To be fair, I''ve had similar with some of my own shots. I could not for the life of me get <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio_mgr.php?collection_id=35578" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this girl</a> to smile for any of the photos I shot.</td>', 'Overall a well done portrait. I like the setting and the effective b/w tones. My one nitpick is the expression on her face seems kind of blah to me. It''s not friendly and inviting, but does not convey anything else to me either. To be fair, I''ve had similar with some of my own shots. I could not for the life of me get this girl to smile for any of the photos I shot.', '2010-12-23 15:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260490, 925840, 56828, '<td valign="top">The crop takes too much emphasis off the little girl.  This could have been a great idea and shot. But my eyes are drawn soo much to the surrounding that she is the last thing I notice. Maybe more lighting on her face could have helped.</td>', 'The crop takes too much emphasis off the little girl.  This could have been a great idea and shot. But my eyes are drawn soo much to the surrounding that she is the last thing I notice. Maybe more lighting on her face could have helped.', '2010-12-23 15:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260491, 925731, 56828, '<td valign="top">Not really sure the point behind the photo.  I keep looking out at the horizon which takes away from her.</td>', 'Not really sure the point behind the photo.  I keep looking out at the horizon which takes away from her.', '2010-12-23 15:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260492, 925715, 56828, '<td valign="top">Focus could be better.</td>', 'Focus could be better.', '2010-12-23 15:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260493, 925919, 65037, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The sharp colors of black/white/red of the subjects play nicely  off the more muted greyes/greens/brown of the background</td>', 'Great capture.  The sharp colors of black/white/red of the subjects play nicely  off the more muted greyes/greens/brown of the background', '2010-12-23 15:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260495, 925878, 65037, '<td valign="top">That lens in the dirt makes me nervous!</td>', 'That lens in the dirt makes me nervous!', '2010-12-23 15:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260500, 925738, 56828, '<td valign="top">Not really a fan of the statue as a portrait, but the filter effect doesn''t do it any justice.</td>', 'Not really a fan of the statue as a portrait, but the filter effect doesn''t do it any justice.', '2010-12-23 15:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260505, 925612, 56828, '<td valign="top">Could benefit from better focus and a tighter crop.</td>', 'Could benefit from better focus and a tighter crop.', '2010-12-23 15:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260506, 925061, 56828, '<td valign="top">The blur at the top works well for the photo.  I would have liked less blur around the legs.  I like using the pier to frame him.</td>', 'The blur at the top works well for the photo.  I would have liked less blur around the legs.  I like using the pier to frame him.', '2010-12-23 15:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260510, 925861, 56828, '<td valign="top">Too much emphasis is placed on the snowstorm and very little is told about the two in the photo.  I think a tigher crop could have changed this.</td>', 'Too much emphasis is placed on the snowstorm and very little is told about the two in the photo.  I think a tigher crop could have changed this.', '2010-12-23 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260511, 925135, 56828, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo and concept.  Your DOF is great.  i wish there were more contrast and less blown out spots, but it''s still a good photo.</td>', 'This is a great photo and concept.  Your DOF is great.  i wish there were more contrast and less blown out spots, but it''s still a good photo.', '2010-12-23 15:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260514, 925874, 56828, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the lighting is that great nor the partial sephia.  The person in the photo looks more like an accident of somoene walking in front of the camera rather than a portrait.</td>', 'I don''t think the lighting is that great nor the partial sephia.  The person in the photo looks more like an accident of somoene walking in front of the camera rather than a portrait.', '2010-12-23 15:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260516, 925857, 56828, '<td valign="top">This could have been a good photo for the challenge if the lighting were a little better.  The light from below and opposite side, is too harsh and causes too many shadows.</td>', 'This could have been a good photo for the challenge if the lighting were a little better.  The light from below and opposite side, is too harsh and causes too many shadows.', '2010-12-23 15:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260633, 925733, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Great job balancing what feels like very different exposures in this photo.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Great job balancing what feels like very different exposures in this photo.', '2010-12-23 20:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260634, 925835, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea behind this, but I don''t like the photo overall. It feels like a much tighter crop would have gone a long way to setting up a better story. As it, it just seems like a quick snapshot using the on camera flash.</td>', 'I really like the idea behind this, but I don''t like the photo overall. It feels like a much tighter crop would have gone a long way to setting up a better story. As it, it just seems like a quick snapshot using the on camera flash.', '2010-12-23 20:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260638, 925876, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good title to add a bit of story behind the photo.</td>', 'Good title to add a bit of story behind the photo.', '2010-12-23 20:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260640, 925695, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good thought. The non-chalantness of the subject is good. But I thing the posts in the railing make this a bit too busy for me.</td>', 'Good thought. The non-chalantness of the subject is good. But I thing the posts in the railing make this a bit too busy for me.', '2010-12-23 20:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260641, 925874, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good thought. Have elements in the foreground and background adds interest. But I''m not really liking the yellow colorcast.</td>', 'Good thought. Have elements in the foreground and background adds interest. But I''m not really liking the yellow colorcast.', '2010-12-23 20:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260642, 925859, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind his shot. But it rally feels like a super heavy dose of noise reduction was used, which is ruining the photo for me.</td>', 'I like the idea behind his shot. But it rally feels like a super heavy dose of noise reduction was used, which is ruining the photo for me.', '2010-12-23 20:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260643, 925813, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Well composed with the leading lines, and very good details where there needs to be details.</td>', 'Very nice. Well composed with the leading lines, and very good details where there needs to be details.', '2010-12-23 20:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260644, 925884, 114225, '<td valign="top">This feels way too much like a quick snapshot candid than a quality portrait.</td>', 'This feels way too much like a quick snapshot candid than a quality portrait.', '2010-12-23 20:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260645, 925665, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good setting for the duotone chosen.</td>', 'Very nice. Good setting for the duotone chosen.', '2010-12-23 20:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260646, 925824, 114225, '<td valign="top">This photo simply isn''t holding any interest for me.</td>', 'This photo simply isn''t holding any interest for me.', '2010-12-23 20:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260647, 925618, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great setup! Nice softness to this photo.</td>', 'Great setup! Nice softness to this photo.', '2010-12-23 20:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260651, 925914, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great setup, except for the light on the ground. I''m just not understanding the meaning behind that.</td>', 'Great setup, except for the light on the ground. I''m just not understanding the meaning behind that.', '2010-12-23 20:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
