(6261924, 925872, 83313, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 5 and expected it to come in a bit lower than that. Offhand the best I can say is that I found nothing compelling about this image. The light is rather plain, there is no story suggested by the image, and nothing makes me want to find out more. I realize that''s fairly vague feedback. I''ll let you know if I come up with something more specific.</td>', 'I gave it a 5 and expected it to come in a bit lower than that. Offhand the best I can say is that I found nothing compelling about this image. The light is rather plain, there is no story suggested by the image, and nothing makes me want to find out more. I realize that''s fairly vague feedback. I''ll let you know if I come up with something more specific.', '2010-12-27 01:04:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6261925, 925107, 96751, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe I knew this was Chuck Close-inspired!!  Marvelous.  Looking forward to more of your work!</td>', 'Can''t believe I knew this was Chuck Close-inspired!!  Marvelous.  Looking forward to more of your work!', '2010-12-27 01:05:04.000000', NULL, 0),
