(6261928, 925920, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m so intrigued by the lights reflected on the ground.  For some odd reason, I thought it was ice, and they were sitting in the middle of an ice-skating rink....</td>', 'I''m so intrigued by the lights reflected on the ground.  For some odd reason, I thought it was ice, and they were sitting in the middle of an ice-skating rink....', '2010-12-27 01:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
