(6264019, 925878, 38162, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by schlake:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I had noticed the misspelling. Why do you think spelling Cory''s name correctly could get you DQ''d? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Because I''m the only person who came here to mock him, and he appears to be the only notable person named Cory.  So calling him out by name easily identifies who I am, which is a violation.  The misspelling, however, is foolproof and protects me from discovery. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yeah, but why go there at all.  we already have enough of a problem with the chummy clique judging that goes on here.</td>', 'Originally posted by schlake: Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: I had noticed the misspelling. Why do you think spelling Cory''s name correctly could get you DQ''d?   Because I''m the only person who came here to mock him, and he appears to be the only notable person named Cory.  So calling him out by name easily identifies who I am, which is a violation.  The misspelling, however, is foolproof and protects me from discovery.   yeah, but why go there at all.  we already have enough of a problem with the chummy clique judging that goes on here.', '2010-12-29 16:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
